// Shaft v2: 8 mm, 162 long, two 12 mm bearing seats (z 38-50, 76-88), SG90 coupler at the top end.
// Coupler: 45 deg flare to r6.5, then a 4.95 mm chamfered blind bore 9 mm deep, the press fit proven on
// models/sg90-rack/press-fit (bore 4.95 with 0.4 chamfer). Prints standing, bore opening up, four mouse-ear pads.
// Wheel positions along the shaft (glue, bores r4.05): compressor z 8-34 (inlet toward z 0), turbines at z 96, 112, 128.
core = (zcyl 4 162.0 |> move 0 0 81.0) ⊕ (zcyl 5 12 |> move 0 0 44.0) ⊕ (zcyl 5 12 |> move 0 0 82.0)
coupler = ((zcyl 4 0.02 |> move 0 0 146.01) ⇓ (zcyl 6.5 0.02 |> move 0 0 148.51)) ⊕ (zcyl 6.5 13.5 |> move 0 0 155.25)
pads = (ω 0.0 (χ 8 (⚓ bot (zcyl 4 0.2)))) ⊕ (ω 90.0 (χ 8 (⚓ bot (zcyl 4 0.2)))) ⊕ (ω 180.0 (χ 8 (⚓ bot (zcyl 4 0.2)))) ⊕ (ω 270.0 (χ 8 (⚓ bot (zcyl 4 0.2))))
main = ((core ⊕ coupler) ⊖ ((zcyl 2.475 9.2 |> move 0 0 157.5) ⊕ ((zcyl 2.875 0.02 |> move 0 0 162.05) ⇓ (zcyl 2.475 0.02 |> move 0 0 161.55)))) ⊕ pads
